        raw = fingerprintMapper.writeValueAsString(
                Map.of("operation", operation, "params", params));
    } catch (JsonProcessingException e) {
        throw ApiException.badRequest("请求参数无法序列化");
    }
    try {
        MessageDigest digest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256");
        return HexFormat.of().formatHex(digest.digest(raw.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8)));
    } catch (NoSuchAlgorithmException e) {
        throw new IllegalStateException("SHA-256 不可用", e);
    }
}
```

Map.of with "operation" and "params" — ORDER_MAP_ENTRIES_BY_KEYS sorts them deterministically. Good.

